1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
B1 FIRST DECISION: inspect LEFT, AHEAD, and RIGHT before choosing.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
LEFT — Check the barangay advisory. A tested radio or charged phone gives the update; the posted marker is always available.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
AHEAD — Measure two wet locations with the depth stick, compare the readings, then choose whether to cross.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
RIGHT — Help the parent and stroller. Packed equipment changes the action.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Work gloves keep the carry task. A whistle calls another adult to carry the bag. No item still allows careful teamwork.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
All three options use the real street layout, rejoin after B1, and never soft-lock an unprepared player.
